2026-09-24 16:52 Fixed on branch worktree-agent-a64b7ebe451800956 commit 2cd8fe9. Root cause: Cmd::Node::Rm built the ssh provider via from_cr without a key (CR carries none, ADR 0027), so OCP::SSH ran with IdentitiesOnly and no identity; login refused = exit 255 in the result hash; ExistingHost::delete_server returned it, Node::teardown only watched for exceptions -> Node+OCPNode deleted, machine untouched. Fix: rm fetches cluster key (provider=>ssh) and passes ssh_key_path; delete_server dies on non-zero exit, uninstall cmd fails if rke2/k3s still on PATH; teardown cordon+drain (Eviction API, 300s, PDB 429 at deadline = fail) then provider delete; any failure -> OCPNode kept phase Failed + message, die (exit 1). make test green 1906. Open: robocop has no teardown path for Terminating OCPNodes (and no pods/eviction RBAC); destroy still prints its fixed warning without the delete_server reason.

